        "linkUrl": "https://github.com/anslwy/vicuna-plugin-slack#create-a-slack-app-manifest-yaml"
      },
      {
        "text": "Click Create, then Install to Workspace (OAuth & Permissions) and copy the Bot User OAuth Token (xoxb-…)."
      },
      {
        "text": "Under Basic Information → App-Level Tokens, generate a token with scope connections:write (xapp-…)."
      },
      {
        "text": "Paste xoxb-… below, then xapp-… when prompted. Finally, DM the bot !pair <code> in Slack (not a public channel). If you created the app From scratch, turn ON Messages Tab + \"Allow users to send Slash commands and messages\" under App Home."
